# Tool Name

## Purpose

What this tool does and when SHARK should reach for it instead of doing the work by hand.

## Usage

```bash
python internaltools/tools/<name>/tool.py <input>
python internaltools/tools/<name>/tool.py <input> --json
```

## Inputs and outputs

- Input: describe arguments, files, or environment expectations.
- Output: describe stdout format and exit codes (`0` success, non-zero failure).

## Dependencies

List third-party packages, if any. Prefer stdlib-only.

## Safety

State authorized-use boundaries, what the tool reads or writes, and what it never does.
